    A15_SMSS_71_M016935_028                                                   
                                                                              
    Apollo 15 Soil Mechanics                                                  
    Lunar Self-Recording Penetrometer (LSRP) Page D-7                         
                                                                              
    Table of LSRP Weights on Moon and Earth                                   
                                                                              
    These handwritten notes give the weights of the components of the Apollo  
    15 Lunar Self-Recording Penetrometer (LSRP) on the Earth and Moon and     
    the conversion factors used in order to calculate the initial force of    
    penetration at the lunar surface.                                         
                                                                              
